{
  "esm": "0.8.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "latlon3d_advection_zonal_central",
    "description": "MMS driver: solid-body zonal advection on the 3-D latlon3d grid, u_t = -omega_deg * D(u, lon) with constant angular velocity omega_deg (deg/s), discretized by grids/latlon3d/rules/central_D_lon_periodic (2nd-order centered interior, explicit periodic wrap columns, rank-3). The rank-3 analogue of problems/latlon_advection_zonal_periodic with a PASSIVE lat axis (NLAT=5, the cos(lat) profile is carried without a lat operator) and a PASSIVE lev axis (NLEV=4, the solution is level-independent). Exact solution u(lon, lat, t) = sin((pi/180)(lon - omega_deg t)) * cos((pi/180) lat) \u2014 the m=1 zonal wave transported rigidly; a constant ANGULAR velocity is latitude-independent, so no metric factor enters the angular-form equation. Periodic in lon with period 360, matching the global recipe closure. GRID CONTRACT WIRING: NLAT=5 and NLEV=4 are closed at the import edge (both passive), NLON stays open (default 144, swept via the loader API); dlon_deg = 360/NLON is an observed dividing by the metaparameter NAME NLON (esm-spec 9.7.6), so the sweep keeps the spacing consistent; lon0_deg = 0. The ic and test references inline lon_i = (i - 1/2) * 360/NLON via the NLON name and lat_j = -90 + (j-1)*45 as literals (build-time scope caveat: the lon_coord/lat_coord templates are not resolvable in build-time ic/reference positions). ERROR MODEL: centered differencing of a single Fourier mode has zero amplitude error and pure phase lag \u2014 semi-discrete phase rate omega k sinc(k dlon) vs exact omega k, k = pi/180 per degree \u2014 so the relative L2 error at time t is 2 sin(delta/2) with delta = omega_deg k t (1 - sinc(2 pi / NLON)), an exact O(dlon^2) ladder identical to the rank-2 sibling's (the extra passive axes change no error). Per-resolution values in tests/conformance/convergence/latlon3d_advection_zonal_central/golden/errors.json.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:latlon3d",
      "equation:advection",
      "mms"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Williamson, D. L., Drake, J. B., Hack, J. J., Jakob, R., & Swarztrauber, P. N. (1992). A standard test set for numerical approximations to the shallow water equations in spherical geometry. Journal of Computational Physics, 102(1), 211-224. Test case 1 (advection by solid-body rotation), restricted to zonal flow."
      },
      {
        "citation": "Roache, P. J. (2002). Code verification by the method of manufactured solutions. J. Fluids Eng. 124(1), 4-10.",
        "doi": "10.1115/1.1436090"
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "ZonalAdvection3d": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../grids/latlon3d/rules/central_D_lon_periodic.esm",
          "bindings": {
            "NLAT": 5,
            "NLEV": 4
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "state",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "lon",
            "lat",
            "lev"
          ],
          "description": "Advected tracer over lon x lat x lev."
        },
        "omega_deg": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "deg/s",
          "default": 90,
          "description": "Constant angular velocity of the solid-body zonal flow (positive eastward)."
        },
        "dlon_deg": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "deg",
          "expression": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              360,
              "NLON"
            ]
          },
          "description": "Zonal spacing 360/NLON: the grid's dlon_deg free name. NLON is the document-scoped metaparameter substituted at load (esm-spec 9.7.6), so the sweep stays consistent."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "ic",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "sin",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          3.141592653589793,
                          180
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "aggregate",
                        "output_idx": [
                          "i",
                          "j",
                          "k"
                        ],
                        "args": [],
                        "ranges": {
                          "i": {
                            "from": "lon"
                          },
                          "j": {
                            "from": "lat"
                          },
                          "k": {
                            "from": "lev"
                          }
                        },
                        "expr": {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "-",
                              "args": [
                                "i",
                                0.5
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "/",
                              "args": [
                                360,
                                "NLON"
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "cos",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          3.141592653589793,
                          180
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "aggregate",
                        "output_idx": [
                          "i",
                          "j",
                          "k"
                        ],
                        "args": [],
                        "ranges": {
                          "i": {
                            "from": "lon"
                          },
                          "j": {
                            "from": "lat"
                          },
                          "k": {
                            "from": "lev"
                          }
                        },
                        "expr": {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            -90,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "j",
                                    1
                                  ]
                                },
                                45
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "D",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ],
            "wrt": "t"
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "omega_deg"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "D",
                "args": [
                  "u"
                ],
                "wrt": "lon"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_solid_body_rotation_3d",
          "description": "Exact solution u = sin((pi/180)(lon - omega_deg t)) cos((pi/180) lat) with omega_deg = 90, level-independent. Derivation: u_t = -omega_deg (pi/180) cos((pi/180)(lon - omega_deg t)) cos((pi/180) lat) = -omega_deg u_lon exactly (u_lon the per-degree derivative the rule discretizes); periodic in lon with period 360; no forcing term. The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring. The t=0.5 assertion (the wave has moved 45 degrees) bounds the centered-difference phase lag 2 sin(delta/2), delta = omega_deg (pi/180) t (1 - sinc(2 pi/NLON)): 2.49e-4 at the default NLON=144 and at worst 2.00e-2 at the sweep's coarsest NLON=16, so the 0.03 bound holds across the whole ladder. The mean assertion pins exact conservation of the centered + wrap scheme (sum(u) telescopes) together with the zero zonal mean of the m=1 wave.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.5
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "sin",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              3.141592653589793,
                              180
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "aggregate",
                            "output_idx": [
                              "i",
                              "j",
                              "k"
                            ],
                            "args": [],
                            "ranges": {
                              "i": {
                                "from": "lon"
                              },
                              "j": {
                                "from": "lat"
                              },
                              "k": {
                                "from": "lev"
                              }
                            },
                            "expr": {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    360,
                                    "NLON"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "cos",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              3.141592653589793,
                              180
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "aggregate",
                            "output_idx": [
                              "i",
                              "j",
                              "k"
                            ],
                            "args": [],
                            "ranges": {
                              "i": {
                                "from": "lon"
                              },
                              "j": {
                                "from": "lat"
                              },
                              "k": {
                                "from": "lev"
                              }
                            },
                            "expr": {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -90,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "j",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    45
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.5,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.03
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "sin",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              3.141592653589793,
                              180
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "aggregate",
                                "output_idx": [
                                  "i",
                                  "j",
                                  "k"
                                ],
                                "args": [],
                                "ranges": {
                                  "i": {
                                    "from": "lon"
                                  },
                                  "j": {
                                    "from": "lat"
                                  },
                                  "k": {
                                    "from": "lev"
                                  }
                                },
                                "expr": {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "i",
                                        0.5
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        360,
                                        "NLON"
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              },
                              45
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "cos",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "/",
                            "args": [
                              3.141592653589793,
                              180
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "aggregate",
                            "output_idx": [
                              "i",
                              "j",
                              "k"
                            ],
                            "args": [],
                            "ranges": {
                              "i": {
                                "from": "lon"
                              },
                              "j": {
                                "from": "lat"
                              },
                              "k": {
                                "from": "lev"
                              }
                            },
                            "expr": {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -90,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "j",
                                        1
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    45
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.5,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "mean"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
